invalid type: string "Welcome to the world of reading!\n\nI'd be happy to help you find some great books to read. Here are three recommendations, each with a brief description:\n\n**Book 1: \"The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy\" by Douglas Adams**\nThis hilarious science fiction series follows the misadventures of an unwitting human and his alien friend as they travel through space.\n\n\"ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ